          <rdf:li>tons of foreshadowing</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>big battle set piece</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Movie Poster Art</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>no one gets a good night's sleep in this somehow</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Family of Choice</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Conspiracy Theories</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Adora has performance anxiety</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Glimmer has survivor's guilt</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Catra has self worth issues (what else is new)</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Minor Bow/Glimmer - Relationship</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Bag>
